{"id":51747,"date":"2026-06-19T06:40:30","date_gmt":"2026-06-19T05:40:30","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51747"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:39:28","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:39:28","slug":"taut-terras-do-anciao-ultra-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/taut-terras-do-anciao-ultra-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"TAUT \u2013 Terras do Anci\u00e3o Ultra Trail 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">TAUT \u2013 Terras do Anci\u00e3o Ultra Trail 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>TAUT \u2013 Terras do Anci\u00e3o Ultra Trail 2027<\/strong> realiza-se de <strong>7 a 14 de Fevereiro de 2027<\/strong>, tendo a sua jornada apote\u00f3tica no domingo, <strong>14 de Fevereiro de 2027<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Ansi\u00e3o<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Organizado pela <strong>Ansibikers<\/strong> com o forte apoio do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Ansi\u00e3o<\/strong>, o TAUT \u00e9 o anfitri\u00e3o exclusivo em Portugal do circuito mundial <strong>TORX\u00ae eXperience<\/strong>, sendo etapa qualificativa para o <em>Tor des G\u00e9ants<\/em> e pontu\u00e1vel para o <strong>UTMB Index<\/strong>, <strong>ITRA<\/strong> e <strong>ATRP<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com quartel-general no Parque Empresarial do Campor\u00eas, o evento atinge uma dimens\u00e3o \u00e9pica atrav\u00e9s dos trilhos calc\u00e1rios do Maci\u00e7o de Sic\u00f3 e das Fragas de S\u00e3o Sim\u00e3o. O programa inclui a m\u00edtica <strong>Ancient Quest 500K<\/strong>, as <strong>150 Milhas<\/strong>, as <strong>100 Milhas<\/strong>, o <strong>TAUTE 110k<\/strong>, o <strong>TAUT 62 km (2236m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>05h45<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Longo 35 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>08h30<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Sprint 20 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong>, o <strong>Mini Trail 13 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10h00<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada \/ Nordic Walking<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10h05<\/strong>, oferecendo aos ultra atletas uma das experi\u00eancias de endurance mais respeitadas da Europa.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(25