nci\u00e3o 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se na semana de <strong>7 a 14 de Fevereiro de 2027<\/strong>, com base log\u00edstica no <strong>Parque Empresarial do Campor\u00eas<\/strong>, em Ansi\u00e3o (Leiria).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O TAUT qualifica para o Tor des G\u00e9ants e UTMB?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, \u00e9 o anfitri\u00e3o exclusivo do circuito <strong>TORX\u00ae eXperience<\/strong> em Portugal e garante pontua\u00e7\u00e3o e pedras qualificativas para o <strong>UTMB Index<\/strong> e <strong>ITRA<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as principais dist\u00e2ncias do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inclui a colossal Ancient Quest 500K, 150M, 100M, 110 km, 62 km, 35 km, 20 km, 13 km e Caminhada \/ Nordic Walking.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como \u00e9 o terreno e a altimetria dos trilhos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso decorre no Maci\u00e7o Calc\u00e1rio de Sic\u00f3, caracterizado por pedra calc\u00e1ria solta, lajedos t\u00e9cnicos, single tracks e fortes desn\u00edveis acumulados.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma <a href=\"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/taut-terras-do-anciao-ultra-trail-2027\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stop&#038;Go<\/a>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"TAUT \u2013 Terras do Anci\u00e3o Ultra Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Parque Empresarial do Campor\u00eas, Ansi\u00e3o, Leiria\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Ansi\u00e3o\", \"addressRegion\": \"Leiria\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Ansibikers e C\u00e2mara Municipal de Ansi\u00e3o\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiz